"value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T23:26:38-07:00","id":952346,"title":"","content":"Now that Promethean second edition is out I've started work on a Dust Bowl game. Need to wait for our current game to end to run it though.<br /> <br /> Random aside but a setting where Alchemy and the slang term &quot;giggle juice&quot; are both things is just awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T06:45:26-07:00","id":952475,"title":"","content":"My partner has been bugging me about playing <b>Mummy </b>again. I'll probably make use of Ruins of Empire again but this time as a prologue rather than the primary time period. I'll probably introduce the Deceived on some level, hoping for another game where she plays one. I would set that in the Cleopatra Era entirely.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, especially with the Companion Eras, I'll probably never run a contemporary campaign again","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T12:05:53-07:00","id":952652,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt-M-McElroy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/943736-dark-eras-what-are-you-guys-playing?p=952205#post952205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As the dev on that chapter I approve. Would love to read more about your game when you get a chance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I plan to do a write-up here eventually, but when it's over or something like that. Sadly, this might take a year or more. :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T15:09:29-07:00","id":952769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/943736-dark-eras-what-are-you-guys-playing?p=952475#post952475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My partner has been bugging me about playing <b>Mummy </b>again. I'll probably make use of Ruins of Empire again but this time as a prologue rather than the primary time period. I'll probably introduce the Deceived on some level, hoping for another game where she plays one. I would set that in the Cleopatra Era entirely.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, especially with the Companion Eras, I'll probably never run a contemporary campaign again</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually had a vague idea of a Mummy game with each chapter set in a new Dark Era. Not just the Mummy specific ones, although my reluctance towards crossover would probably see the bulk of the non-historical information excised.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}